  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Since you are just starting your adventure, you''ll need somethin'' to
    train with. I bought a sword off some wierd fella - looked half mad, but the
    blade was decent. Wait, where''d I put it? Agh, right! I forgot it at Joe''s.
    Go talk to the Blacksmith - he''s holdin'' on to a weapon worthy of a hero like
    you!


